      "isSimulated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "iletisim_bilgileri",
      "blogSlug": "sedef-adasi",
      "titles": {
        "tr": "Faydalı Telefonlar",
        "en": "Various Contact Information"
      },
      "contents": {
        "tr": "<p>Tüm acil durumlar için: <strong>112</strong></p>\n<p>İSKİ, çağrı merkezi: <strong>185</strong></p>\n<p>Adalar İSKİ Şube Müdürlüğü: <strong>(216) 382 62 15</strong></p>\n<p>Büyükada Polis Amirliği: <strong>(216) 382 50 10</strong></p>\n<p>Büyükada İtfaiye: <strong>(216) 382 68 21</strong></p>\n<p>Adalar Belediyesi Veterinerlik: <strong>(216) 382 75 94</strong></p>\n<p>İBB Adalar Koordinatörlüğü: <strong>(216) 586 57 61</strong></p>\n<p>Kartal İlçe Emniyet Müdürlüğü: <strong>(216) 488 25 48</strong></p>\n<p>Lütfi Kırdar Arş. Hastanesi Başhekimliği: <strong>(216) 458 30 01</strong></p>\n<p>Yavuz Selim Devlet Hastanesi Başhekimliği: <strong>(216) 387 03 80</strong></p>\n<p>Istanbul Deniz Taksi: <strong>0542 357 66 72</strong></p>\n<p>Marketim Kartal: <strong>(216) 473 62 89 - 0552 473 6289</strong></p>\n<p>Elio Sedef: <strong>(216) 382 48 84</strong> - <a href=\"http://eliosedef.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">eliosedef.com</a></p>\n<p>Club Ada Sedef: <strong>0532 345 51 45</strong> - <a href=\"mailto:info@niltugtuner.com.tr\">info@niltugtuner.com.tr</a></p>",
        "en": "<p>For all emergencies: <strong>112</strong></p>\n<p>İSKİ call center: <strong>185</strong></p>\n<p>Princely Islands İSKİ Branch Office: <strong>(216) 382 62 15</strong></p>\n<p>Büyükada Police Headquarters: <strong>(216) 382 50 10</strong></p>\n<p>Büyükada Fire Station: <strong>(216) 382 68 21</strong></p>\n<p>Princely Islands Municipality Veterinary Services: <strong>(216) 382 75 94</strong></p>\n<p>İBB Princely Islands Coordination: <strong>(216) 586 57 61</strong></p>\n<p>Kartal District Police Department: <strong>(216) 488 25 48</strong></p>\n<p>Lütfi Kırdar Research Hospital Chief Physician: <strong>(216) 458 30 01</strong></p>\n<p>Yavuz Selim State Hospital Chief Physician: <strong>(216) 387 03 80</strong></p>\n<p>Istanbul Sea Taxi: <strong>0542 357 66 72</strong></p>\n<p>Marketim Kartal: <strong>(216) 473 62 89 - 0552 473 6289</strong></p>\n<p>Elio Sedef: <strong>(216) 382 48 84</strong> - <a href=\"http://eliosedef.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">eliosedef.com</a></p>\n<p>Club Ada Sedef: <strong>0532 345 51 45</strong> - <a href=\"mailto:info@niltugtuner.com.tr\">info@niltugtuner.com.tr</a></p>"
      },
